TEXT 32 24 Left 3 ;ONE CHANNEL / CH1 - INPUT PROTECTION + SCHMITT BUFFER
TEXT 32 64 Left 2 ;R6/R7: 1k PR02 Cu-lead 2W 1% (pulse rated). R8=330R; R9=47k; R10=33R.
TEXT 32 96 Left 2 ;Default CASE=2: +200V / 1ms single pulse. Change CASE below: 0=12V DC, 1=logic square, 2=surge.
TEXT 1040 384 Left 2 ;XU2: approximate SN74LVC1G17DBVR
TEXT 1040 416 Left 2 ;6pF input, 2.20/1.10V thresholds; 3.3V supply
TEXT 1040 448 Left 2 ;CLOAD=10p is an assumed Pico/wire load.
TEXT 352 560 Left 2 ;XD3 contains both diodes of ONE BAV99. D4 is ONE BZX85C3V3.
TEXT 352 592 Left 2 ;Z is an ISOLATED clamp node. Never connect Z or A to the Pico 3V3 supply.
TEXT 32 656 Left 2 !.include protection_models.lib
TEXT 32 696 Left 2 !.param CASE=2 VSUP=3.3 VLOGIC=3.3 FREQ=1Meg
TEXT 32 736 Left 2 !.param VLO={12*(CASE==0)} VHI={12*(CASE==0)+VLOGIC*(CASE==1)+200*(CASE==2)}
TEXT 32 776 Left 2 !.param TD={10u-9u*(CASE==1)} TR={20n-15n*(CASE==1)}
TEXT 32 816 Left 2 !.param PW={(CASE==1)*(0.5/FREQ-TR)+(1-(CASE==1))*1m} PER={(CASE==1)/FREQ+(1-(CASE==1))*10m}
TEXT 32 856 Left 2 !.param TSTOP={(CASE==1)*(1u+10/FREQ)+(1-(CASE==1))*1.1m} TMAX={(CASE==1)/(500*FREQ)+(1-(CASE==1))*20n}
TEXT 32 896 Left 2 !.tran {TMAX} {TSTOP} 0 {TMAX}
TEXT 32 936 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0 method=gear maxord=1
TEXT 1376 656 Left 2 !.meas tran A_MAX MAX V(A)
TEXT 1376 696 Left 2 !.meas tran CLAMP_MAX MAX V(CLAMP)
TEXT 1376 736 Left 2 !.meas tran OUT_MAX MAX V(OUT)
TEXT 1376 776 Left 2 !.meas tran IIN_MIN MIN I(VIN)
TEXT 1008 880 Left 2 ;Probe V(IN), V(CLAMP), V(A), V(OUT); I(VIN) is negative into DUT input.
TEXT 32 1000 Left 2 ;IMPORTANT: representative diode/logic models, NOT vendor-qualified SPICE models.
TEXT 32 1032 Left 2 ;No thermal failure, worst-case protection, ESD or Ioff verification. Read README.md before interpreting results.
TEXT 32 1064 Left 2 ;One physical circuit only. CASE changes its test stimulus. All local .asy/.lib files must stay with this .asc.
